    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640120/extras/4eefdbbba9b47909cd92eae4decb4cae.avif?t=1752866298\" width=570 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of a flawed man who, after losing the love of his life, finds himself at a crossroads, unsure whether to open his heart once more. Though there is no perfect path forward, life always has a way of surprising us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640120/extras/192d6f5e2764e7a1cabac1423b0b3918.avif?t=1752866298\" width=570 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconnect with old friends, rekindle the flame with a past lover, or start a brand-new relationship\u2014the choice is yours. Every road you take leads to a completely different path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No choice is without consequence; paths collide, and the choices you make impact everyone and everything around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640120/extras/ca6c7b0a1381c71a2145fb3bf53b3839.avif?t=1752866298\" width=570 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in uncensored sexual relationships and savor each moment with your partner of choice. Behind closed doors, everyone has their own secret desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640120/extras/a6aee7c74178d5725c74ee0bfcd1b4fc.avif?t=1752866298\" width=570 